evals/results/

# The competitor watch writes its report here on every run (upstream-watch R4);
# it is a build artifact, like packages/compat-oracle/upstream.json.
packages/compat-oracle/competitors-upstream.json

# Agent worktrees: whole copies of this repo, several gigabytes of them, and one
# `git add -A` from being committed. Every tool that walks the tree has to be
# told to skip them — eslint and markdownlint are, and this stops git and
# ripgrep having to be told twice. `launch.json` beside them is local dev-server
# config, not something another machine wants.
.claude/
